window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"mel","b":"masteryi","win":["Mel","Mel","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-2","text":"Unanswerable poke — he cannot enter your range"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander grants slow immunity — land the centre root"},{"when":"Full Overwhelm stacks","text":"R burst chunks him — but never fire into Alpha Strike"}],"wants":{"you":["A big early CS and HP lead from poke","E for Meditate, W for burst","Peel-heavy teamfights"],"foe":["Alpha engages once level 3 hits","Your root baited before the all-in","Sidelane duels at any item count"]},"early":"Own the first two levels: Radiant Volley at 950 and your 550 auto mean he literally cannot reach you, so chip him on every CS attempt and shove for a fast level lead. Once Alpha Strike comes online at 3 the free lunches end — it is 20s at rank 1, but his basic attacks cut it down, so count it off his farming.","mid":"From 4-5 one landed engage kills you, so play the wave off your tower, hold E for his commit and burn W the instant he starts the all-in. Meditate is a channel, so a Solar Snare root cancels the heal outright — that is the one time spending it early pays. At 6 the dive comes the moment your root is down.","late":"You do not beat him in any 1v1 past his first item, so make the map his problem instead: shove from max range, group early and sit behind two bodies of peel. Root him mid-dive, blank his burst with Rebuttal, and hold Golden Eclipse until Alpha Strike ends — he is untargetable for all of it.","whys":["Your Radiant Volley at 950 and Solar Snare at 1000 out-range him completely at level 1 — he cannot reach you.","At 2 your poke and reflect still deny him any close-range trade — keep kiting off his approach.","Level 3 brings Alpha Strike — 20s at rank 1, and he is untargetable for its whole flight, so your free lane ends.","By 4-5 his Wuju true damage bursts your squishy HP bar and you have no escape — one landed engage kills you.","At 6 Highlander makes him immune to slows, so only the centre root of Solar Snare holds him — land it dead on.","With attack speed online he deletes you before you can reset the distance — first item makes his engage lethal.","Late his Alpha dodges and Highlander resets out-scale you entirely — never be the champion he is allowed to reach."]});
